'''The Torrent's Reclamation''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Cloth Belt}}.

==Mechanics==
{{sl|Summon Greater Harbinger of Time}}: Summons a minion which will cast {{stl|The Torrent's Reclamation}} aura buff on the player every 10 seconds. The buff lasts for 8 seconds and grants 10% increased [[action speed]].

This version of the skill doesn't affect enemies, unlike [[Summon Harbinger of Time|the regular version]].
